{"id": "99210118", "name": "זמן חיים עם צפיפות λ²te^(−λt) – תוחלת, זנב, ולפחות שתיים מתוך n", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>זמן החיים (בחודשים) של שפופרת הוא משתנה מקרי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span> עם פונקציית הצפיפות<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(t)=\\begin{cases}{{CT:0}}, & t\\ge0\\\\ 0, & t\\lt 0\\end{cases} \\]</p></p><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">א. חשבו את תוחלת זמן החיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X]\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ב. מה ההסתברות ששפופרת תחזיק מעמד לפחות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span> חודשים?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p class=\"input-hint\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">את \\(e^{-3}\\) מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">exp(-3)</code> (או <code dir=\"ltr\">e^(-3)</code>).</p><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ג. במפעל מותקנות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span> שפופרות בלתי תלויות. מה ההסתברות שלפחות שתיים מהן יחזיקו מעמד לפחות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span> חודשים?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div><p class=\"input-hint\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">את \\(e^{-3}\\) מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">exp(-3)</code> (או <code dir=\"ltr\">e^(-3)</code>).</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> אינטגרציה בחלקים לתוחלת ולזנב; בסעיף ג – מספר השפופרות שמחזיקות מעמד הוא בינומי.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — התוחלת</b><br>באינטגרציה בחלקים (פעמיים):<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[X]=\\int_0^\\infty t\\cdot {{CT:3}}\\,t\\,e^{-{{CT:4}}t}dt={{CT:3}}\\cdot\\frac{2}{ {{CT:5}} }={{CT:6}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הזנב</b><br>באינטגרציה בחלקים:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}(X\\ge {{CT:1}})=\\int_{ {{CT:1}} }^\\infty {{CT:3}}\\,t\\,e^{-{{CT:4}}t}dt=\\left[-(1+{{CT:4}}t)e^{-{{CT:4}}t}\\right]_{ {{CT:1}} }^{\\infty}=(1+{{CT:7}})e^{-{{CT:7}}}={{CT:8}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — לפחות שתיים</b><br>יהי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span> מספר השפופרות שמחזיקות לפחות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span> חודשים. <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\sim\\mathrm{Bin}({{CT:2}},p)\\)</span> עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p={{CT:8}}\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}(W\\ge2)=1-(1-p)^{ {{CT:2}} }-{{CT:2}}\\,p\\,(1-p)^{ {{CT:9}} }\\approx{{CT:10}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]][[feedback:prt3]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 48, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "t1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "pp", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "t3", "testoptions": nul